# Sidecar ignore (buildx honors <dockerfile>.dockerignore) — keeps the repo-root
# build context light. This runner COPYs only connectors/queen-s3 and two files
# under test/runners; everything else is weight on every build.
#
# `**/target` is the load-bearing line: connectors/queen-s3/target is a couple of
# gigabytes on a developer machine and would be tarred into the context on every
# build, then thrown away by the stage that rebuilds it anyway.
.git
.claude
server
proxy
protocols
app
webapp
webdoc
clients
crates
examples
assets
helm
helm_v1
helm_queen
benchmark-queen
**/target
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.log
